   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\text{Draw }{y=\\tan x}\\text{ and }{y=x}\\text{. They meet at the}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{origin. In each branch of tan beyond}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{the first, the steep curve crosses}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{the line once.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
